WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,790
Don't worry

2
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:01,800
Let's go and take pictures of them

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:10,160
You can only buy if you have a gold river in your hand. Don’t rob me. If I have a gold river, let me go. I have money and I have it. Let me buy first. I have an old mother and children at home. Let me buy first.

4
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,840
Who doesn't have a team of people waiting for dinner?

5
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:20,780
Don't hit me. What's my point? Why don't you get out of here?

6
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:28,820
It's not just He Fan who has disappeared. Others will come. Don't worry.

7
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,860
Who has Jin He? Raise your hand to show that I have it.

8
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,300
I have a golden river, so do I

9
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,300
Boss, I can do it for you

10
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,750
Come over here and score points. It’s done.

11
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:40,870
I exchanged this Gold River for one hundred hit points. Which meal do I want in the card?

12
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:46,420
Fish-flavored shredded pork rice is so good. Raise your hand to let me know and my boss saw it.
